# Loot, the Pathfinder: "Exhaust - {G}, {T}: Add three mana of any one color", "Exhaust - {U}, {T}: Draw three cards" and
# "Exhaust - {R}, {T}: Loot deals 3 damage to any target. (Activate each exhaust ability only once.)" Bot1 casts the
